{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were tired of modern life, hard and empty. Until, at the end of the day, a request for change is granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown system teleports you to another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in another world, you find yourself in another world. Now with different clothes, forests, and a skill system, you need to hunt and find out what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse world with forests, villages, caves, alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt to survive, seek knowledge to create your base and your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate bosses and predators to improve your skills and equipment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684830?t=1757613532","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684830?t=1757613532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684830/a0d5a8eeda463c6391bda07c2ac6fdad3c9e6e3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757613532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684830/a0d5a8eeda463c6391bda07c2ac6fdad3c9e6e3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757613532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3927510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were tired of modern life, hard and empty. Until, at the end of the day, a request for change is granted.<